---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How this static blog handles hosting logs, RSS subscriptions, external links, and future advertising changes.">
  <section class="hero"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Last updated: November 4, 2026.</p></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>teimakes is a static blog operated by Taieui Song and hosted on GitHub Pages. The blog currently has no account system, email subscription form, analytics scripts, advertising scripts, or tracking pixels.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and access logs</h2>
    <p>GitHub may process technical information, including visitors' IP addresses, to provide and secure GitHub Pages. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/pages/getting-started-with-github-pages/what-is-github-pages">GitHub's explanation of Pages data collection</a> and <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a> for details.</p>
    <h2>Subscriptions</h2>
    <p>RSS and JSON Feed are public files. This blog does not ask for an email address to subscribe. If you use a feed reader, its provider's privacy policy applies to that service.</p>
    <h2>External links and contact</h2>
    <p>Links to social profiles, research, code, and other websites take you to services with their own privacy policies. If you contact me through LinkedIn or GitHub, those services process the information you choose to share. GitHub issues are public; please do not post personal or sensitive information there.</p>
    <h2>Future changes</h2>
    <p>Advertising or analytics may be considered in the future. This page will be updated to describe any providers, purposes, data use, and applicable choices before those features are enabled.</p>
    <p>For questions about this blog, contact <a href={SITE.social.LinkedIn}>Taieui Song on LinkedIn</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
